    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of the 18 available characters to play with. Pick carefully! Each character has different knowledge and might help you if you don\u2019t know the answer to a question. For example if you select the Chemist he can help you with a Science Question.<br>The game includes 3.500 questions in 8 different categories: <br>- Arts<br>- Celebrities<br>- Cinema/TV<br>- General Knowledge<br>- Geography<br>- History<br>- Science<br>- Sports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is called Select Quiz because the player can exclude a category or select to play with a single category of questions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of the 18 available characters to play with. Pick carefully! Each character has different knowledge and might help you if you don\u2019t know the answer to a question. For example if you select the Chemist he can help you with a Science Question.<br>The game includes 3.500 questions in 8 different categories: <br>- Arts<br>- Celebrities<br>- Cinema/TV<br>- General Knowledge<br>- Geography<br>- History<br>- Science<br>- Sports</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is called Select Quiz because the player can exclude a category or select to play with a single category of questions.</p>",
